{"reference":"Jeremiah 45","book":"Jeremiah","chapter":45,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"Jeremiah in Its Larger Setting","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"Jeremiah 45 falls within the book’s broad 34–45 division in one practical outline of the received text. The book as a whole brings together several forms of material, including poetry, prose sermons, narratives, letters, headings, repeated accounts, restoration collections, oracles concerning nations, and an appendix. This outline is a way of locating the chapter within the book’s present arrangement; it does not settle how the book was composed.","verse_refs":["Jeremiah 10:1-25","Jeremiah 11:1-23","Jeremiah 12:1-17","Jeremiah 13:1-27","Jeremiah 14:1-22","Jeremiah 15:1-21","Jeremiah 16:1-21","Jeremiah 17:1-27","Jeremiah 18:1-23","Jeremiah 19:1-15","Jeremiah 1:1-19","Jeremiah 20:1-18","Jeremiah 21:1-14","Jeremiah 22:1-30","Jeremiah 23:1-40","Jeremiah 24:1-10","Jeremiah 25:1-38","Jeremiah 26:1-24","Jeremiah 27:1-22","Jeremiah 28:1-17","Jeremiah 29:1-32","Jeremiah 2:1-37","Jeremiah 30:1-24","Jeremiah 31:1-40","Jeremiah 32:1-44","Jeremiah 33:1-26","Jeremiah 34:1-22","Jeremiah 35:1-19","Jeremiah 36:1-32","Jeremiah 37:1-21","Jeremiah 38:1-28","Jeremiah 39:1-18","Jeremiah 3:1-25","Jeremiah 40:1-16","Jeremiah 41:1-18","Jeremiah 42:1-22","Jeremiah 43:1-13","Jeremiah 44:1-30","Jeremiah 46:1-28","Jeremiah 47:1-7","Jeremiah 48:1-47","Jeremiah 49:1-39","Jeremiah 4:1-31","Jeremiah 50:1-46","Jeremiah 51:1-64","Jeremiah 52:1-34","Jeremiah 5:1-31","Jeremiah 6:1-30","Jeremiah 7:1-34","Jeremiah 8:1-22","Jeremiah 9:1-26"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_jeremiah_045_182d4122b25d64c37a349e31"],"confidence":"medium","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}